## 4. termux-dev (`devx`) — MIT

**Upstream:** <https://github.com/apvcode/Termux-Dev>
**License:** MIT License, Copyright (c) ApvCode
**Used as:** the provider catalogue and model metadata in
`app/src/main/assets/providers/` — `providers.json` (178 provider presets),
`model-limits.json` (context-window table) and `model-pricing.json` (price table),
ported verbatim from `devx`'s `dist/cli/providers.js` and `dist/core/*.json`.
The Kotlin port lives in `app/src/main/java/com/termagent/provider/`
(`ProviderRegistry`, `ModelCatalog`, `ModelDiscovery`), which reproduces `devx`'s
lookup order (exact model id → last `/` path segment → version-stripped base name
→ family heuristic → default) and its `GET {baseUrl}/models` discovery call.

